 {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "2412327085529357", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "26194005696934829"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "2309851355956647"}]}, "change_log": "## Update v806.01\n\n## New Course: GOLF+ Original Dynasty\nTowering high above the clouds, Dynasty weaves through ancient terraces, stone temples, and dramatic cliffs. Serene, otherworldly, and rich with history, it blends calm beauty with bold elevation and unforgettable views.\n\n### Upcoming Drops:\nAzalea Collection \u201926 available starting tomorrow!\n- Driver & Fairway Wood set\n- Iron & Wedges set\n- 1 Blade & Mallet Putter\n- 1 Golf Ball\n- 1 Golf Bag\n- 1 Club Shaft\n- 1 Club & Putter Grip\n- Complete set of Headcovers\n\nBaseball themed Diamond Collection coming 4/16!\n- 1 Golf Bag\n- 2 Golf Balls\n- 1 Club & Putter Grip\n- Complete set of Headcovers\n\n### Quality:\n- Fixed an issue that prevented further gameplay when receiving an invite as the room becomes filled.\n- Fixed instances in Scramble where you could hit your ball again after your initial shot before the Captain selected a shot.\n- Addressed scenarios where the \"Next Hole\" button would not show after modifying a Scramble game without changing any settings.\n\n### Course Updates:\n- Sawgrass: Hole 15 - Corrected the collision on the tree near the Front tee boxes", "created_date": 1775148462, "id": "26181249028210496", "version": "806.01", "version_code": 15768, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 114}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}]}}, "viewer": {"user": null}}}